            {
                "entry_id": "71dfd6d5-cebf-3441-a3dc-42e9cb6c684e",
                "word": "pit-a-pat",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7d5c110d-259d-3427-a3a7-96343b1fafc5",
                        "entry_id": "71dfd6d5-cebf-3441-a3dc-42e9cb6c684e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Characterized by quick tapping sounds; palpitating."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9943b14-b495-4b49-8078-11d900dfa4b8",
                                "sense_id": "7d5c110d-259d-3427-a3a7-96343b1fafc5",
                                "text": "The chesnut ringlets were speedily twitched from the confining paper, her Sunday hat, gown, and neckerchief bustled on in a moment, and wondering what he would say, and how she should feel and behave on the trying occasion, she descended with a pit-a-pat heart, and a cheek covered with burning blushes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b324ffe-048a-4cc5-9005-2a68b45c85f7",
                                "sense_id": "7d5c110d-259d-3427-a3a7-96343b1fafc5",
                                "text": "The pit-a-pat heart of a susceptible girl of sixteen, tells her that a gentleman is a tall fellow with a fine military cap on his head; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "49f1470c-61c1-499d-97ab-0e6da4bc99bc",
                                "sense_id": "7d5c110d-259d-3427-a3a7-96343b1fafc5",
                                "text": "Dear Hannah—you learn from your aunt to conceal / The things that your parents do bid you reveal— / ’Tis true, I am Henry, and Anderton, too, / But that’s not an answer expected from you— / You, yesterday, called me a very dear name, / Which set my poor pit-a-pat heart in a flame: / Speak! am I your “uncle?” The truth I would know; / I wonder who taught you to speak to me so!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "84d35ad8-ebeb-3451-a186-68fb156e7071",
                "word": "pit-a-pat",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5d756516-f0a9-3f9a-920e-9f04f2c883df",
                        "entry_id": "84d35ad8-ebeb-3451-a186-68fb156e7071",
                        "glosses": [
                            "With a quick tapping sound"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d31a5388-3b6e-4a8a-8729-639eecf76788",
                                "sense_id": "5d756516-f0a9-3f9a-920e-9f04f2c883df",
                                "text": "“Only a scraping of shoes on the mat? / “Anything like the sound of a rat / “Makes my heart go pit-a-pat!”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "fe5d2f7c-176b-3b9d-ae7e-439239db5cf4",
                "word": "pit-a-pat",
                "pos": "intj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "530d2dec-d295-3226-8feb-72e994cdc13c",
                        "entry_id": "fe5d2f7c-176b-3b9d-ae7e-439239db5cf4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Representing a series of quick tapping sounds."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "69286494-bf19-4d97-a71f-493c880e1d3f",
                                "sense_id": "530d2dec-d295-3226-8feb-72e994cdc13c",
                                "text": "Pit-a-pat, pit-a-pat, the bullets kept falling and stirring up little puffs of dust on the open ground in front of the zeriba."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec89673a-4792-4dbf-87dd-b75e8560de87",
                                "sense_id": "530d2dec-d295-3226-8feb-72e994cdc13c",
                                "text": "“Pit-a-pat! Pit-a-pat!”—On go the thousands of feet; on to the movie and on to the dance; on to the office, the club and the bank."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f2821cb-045a-4702-bc89-e330ce81acb2",
                                "sense_id": "530d2dec-d295-3226-8feb-72e994cdc13c",
                                "text": "Pit-a-pat, pit-a-pat, pit-a-pat, pit-a-pat, / He danced on the whiskery nose."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
